Output pkgs/artisanal/assets/glamour_demo.gif

Require dart

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "DejaVu Sans Mono"
Set FontSize 16
Set LetterSpacing 0
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.25
Set CursorBlink false

Type "dart run build/vhs/artisanal/glamour_demo.dill"
Enter
Wait+Screen /Glamour Theme Demo/
Sleep 6s
